SDL-E1026 (spec/README.md#design-rules-settled)

  x `frobnicate<int>` is not a SurrealQL kind
   ,----
 1 | fn price($a: frobnicate<int>) { 1 };
   :              ^^^^^^^^|^^^^^^^
   :                      `-- not a SurrealQL kind
   `----
  help: kinds mirror SurrealQL's own: `option<T>`, `record<T>`, `array<T, N>`, unions (`int | float`), literal kinds — spec/README.md rule 4
